        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Upgrades:</strong> 1</p><hr /><p>The study of Triaxan space worms in cryo-anesthesia research led to first frostmaw, an armored, toothy tube that can be wielded as a weapon. A frostmaw can't be reloaded, but the liquid inside regenerates at a rate of 1 projectile every round. These weapons are living creatures that can be directed by telepathic wielders. Unlike most area weapons, a frostmaw can be used to make ranged Strikes, expending a single projectile with a range increment of 15 feet.</p>"
